  title="How to show keystrokes in a Mac screen recording"
  lede="The Screenshot toolbar and QuickTime Player record the screen, the microphone and optionally the pointer, but Apple's pages list no option for showing the keys you press. Reelbird has a keystroke overlay: turn on Record keystrokes before you record, grant two permissions, and decide in the editor whether it appears."
  crumbs={[{ name: "Guides", path: "/guides/" }, { name: "Show keystrokes", path }]}
